                                                "sense_id": "985e9b8e-2e42-3452-9548-25dcd520f10a",
                                                "text": "About 250,000 poods of yuft are prepared annually, of which about 150,000 poods are red yuft, manufactured chiefly for foreign markets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
